asset:        identifier-00-defaults.png
title:        Reference render of composition identifier-00-defaults (frame at 0.5 s, 320 x 180, 16 bit RGBA) as After Effects 2026 draws it
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       rendered by Adobe After Effects 2026 (26.2.1x2) on Windows 11 with saveFrameToPng from composition identifier-00-defaults of aep/1300-thirdparty.aep and aep/1310-identifier-uint.aep (tools/aep/importer-samples/jsx/lib.jsx; docs/aep/2026-11-05-importer-samples.md)
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: ../../LICENSE-MIT, ../../LICENSE-APACHE
added:        2026-11-05 by @vangel76
notes:        Reference output of the application, not of EffectCraft: the expected look of the variant for later render comparisons. The file contains only the IHDR, IDAT and IEND chunks (no colour profile, text, time stamp or other metadata chunk). The same composition name exists in 1300-thirdparty and 1310-identifier-uint; the file kept here is the later run (1310-identifier-uint).
